          "Spellcraft"
        ],
        "skillPoints": "2 + Int",
        "description": "Sorcerer variant with d8 Hit Dice and Cleric base attack progression. Intimidate replaces Bluff as a class skill. Gains light armor proficiency and one chosen light or one-handed martial weapon. Light armor causes no arcane failure for spells from this class. Each available spell level has one fewer daily slot (minimum zero) and one fewer spell known (minimum one) than a normal Sorcerer."
